f. empowerment;
g. cooperation;
h. guidance and Supervision;
i. funding; andj. criminal provisions.

Article 20

Legal aid as referred to in Article 17 paragraph (1) letter c to assist victims in undergoing the judicial process by: a. providing legal consultation that includes information regarding victims' rights and the judicial process;
